WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:16.250
Liu Bei went back to fighting Yellow Turban rebels.

2
00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:23.010
Meanwhile the imperial court in Luoyang remained in chaos for many years.

3
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.080
In the year 189, Emperor Ling died.

4
00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:34.419
Dong Zhuo made the emperor's youngest son the new emperor.

5
00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:38.720
Emperor Xian was only nine years old.

6
00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:44.320
Dong Zhuo was able to control him and gain much more power.

7
00:00:47.142 --> 00:00:52.853
One day an imperial adviser named Wang Yun received a report.

8
00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:58.520
A river had flooded, destroying crops and leaving many farmers homeless.

9
00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:05.709
Wang Yun hurried to the emperor's study.

10
00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:09.410
"Your Majesty. May I have a word with you?"

11
00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:13.310
Emperor Xian looked up. "Please come in."

12
00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:19.950
Wang Yun told the emperor about the flooding.

13
00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:26.190
"That's terrible," the young emperor said. "What should we do?"

14
00:01:27.030 --> 00:01:32.670
"I think we should send food and money." Wang Yun rubbed his chin.

15
00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:38.670
"Perhaps one of our engineers can fix the river's banks so this doesn't happen again."

16
00:01:39.517 --> 00:01:42.549
Emperor Xian smiled eagerly.

17
00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:46.570
"That is an excellent idea. I don't want people to suffer."

18
00:01:47.105 --> 00:01:55.807
Dong Zhuo burst into the study. "What are you two talking about?"

19
00:01:55.808 --> 00:02:00.629
"There was a flood," Wang Yun said. "We were discussing what to—"

20
00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:05.307
"Why didn't you come to me?" Dong Zhuo asked.

21
00:02:05.308 --> 00:02:09.302
"Well," Wang Yun said. "The emperor is . . ."

22
00:02:09.303 --> 00:02:12.725
"A child!" Dong Zhuo snapped.

23
00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:16.960
"He doesn't know anything. Give me that report."

24
00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:22.260
He snatched it from Wang Yun, read it, and then threw it on the floor.

25
00:02:22.729 --> 00:02:28.432
"Hmph! We don't need to help a bunch of poor farmers!"

26
00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:32.520
Emperor Xian sat low in his chair and said nothing.

27
00:02:33.607 --> 00:02:36.442
Wang Yun cleared his throat.

28
00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:39.860
"But sir, those farmers are suffering.

29
00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:45.182
And if the emperor helps them, they will be thankful and loyal."

30
00:02:45.183 --> 00:02:58.219
Dong Zhuo laughed. "We don't need to help them. They'll be loyal—or else!"

31
00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:04.680
Wang Yun left the emperor's study, feeling worried about Dong Zhuo's influence.

32
00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:09.160
Over the following weeks, he felt even worse.

33
00:03:09.392 --> 00:03:13.975
Dong Zhuo never showed respect toward Emperor Xian.

34
00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:18.420
Instead he marched around and acted as if he were the emperor!

35
00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:23.980
When Dong Zhuo wasn't at the palace, he and his army attacked villages.

36
00:03:24.684 --> 00:03:27.279
He claimed to be fighting Yellow Turbans.

37
00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:33.560
But Wang Yun soon received a letter from General Yuan Shao, who said otherwise.

38
00:03:33.972 --> 00:03:37.766
The general was stationed outside Luoyang.

39
00:03:37.767 --> 00:03:40.849
Dear Wang Yun,

40
00:03:40.850 --> 00:03:44.433
Dong Zhuo attacked a village yesterday.

41
00:03:44.580 --> 00:03:48.960
He said Yellow Turbans lived there, but that is a lie.

42
00:03:49.142 --> 00:03:54.779
He and his men stole valuables and burned the homes of innocent people.

43
00:03:54.780 --> 00:04:00.220
I've heard you are a good man, and a close adviser to the emperor.

44
00:04:00.829 --> 00:04:05.391
Please do something to stop Dong Zhuo!

45
00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:06.720
Sincerely,

46
00:04:06.837 --> 00:04:10.641
General Yuan Shao

47
00:04:10.642 --> 00:04:20.016
"I must fix this situation." Wang Yun sighed. "But I need help."

48
00:04:20.017 --> 00:04:23.796
Cao Cao sat in his office, fuming.

49
00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:28.190
He had a government job in Luoyang, but he wasn't happy.

50
00:04:28.670 --> 00:04:32.070
"Dong Zhuo is a tyrant," he thought.

51
00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:35.970
"I can't let him tear our empire apart any longer."

52
00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:38.690
A messenger came in with a letter.

53
00:04:39.267 --> 00:04:43.486
It was an invitation to a birthday party for Wang Yun.

54
00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:49.870
Late that night Cao Cao went to Wang Yun's house, expecting a party.

55
00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:58.057
Instead he found a few officials gathered in a room.

56
00:04:58.058 --> 00:05:01.421
"Thank you for coming," Wang Yun said.

57
00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:05.520
"As you can see, this is not a birthday party.

58
00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:10.900
I only said that to avoid suspicion." He took a deep breath.

59
00:05:11.284 --> 00:05:14.922
"We must get rid of Dong Zhuo."

60
00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:17.160
Everyone in the room murmured.

61
00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:19.859
"I agree, but how?"

62
00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:22.620
"He's too powerful!"

63
00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:25.640
"He's controlling the emperor!"

64
00:05:26.225 --> 00:05:30.141
"That's enough complaining!" Cao Cao shouted.

65
00:05:30.340 --> 00:05:33.224
Everyone turned around to look at him.

66
00:05:33.225 --> 00:05:44.444
Cao Cao had a sly smile. "Leave it to me. I'll assassinate Dong Zhuo."
